From: lihuu <lihuu@example.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: Add view raw config feature with multiple outbound support

This patch adds a "View Raw Config" menu item that displays the complete
V2Ray configuration JSON. It also adds support for passing profile items
to the config generation for better multi-outbound handling.

Changes:
- Added RawConfigActivity to display raw config JSON
- Added menu item for viewing raw config
- Updated V2rayConfigManager to accept optional profileItems parameter
- Added MainViewModel.createV2RayConfig helper method
- Updated MainActivity to handle the new menu item
- Added necessary layout and manifest entries

